## 5. Safety Mechanisms Summary

| ID | Mechanism | ASIL | SWC/BSW | Detection | Reaction |
|:---|:----------|:----:|:--------|:----------|:---------|
| SM-01 | MPU Violation Detect | B | BSW | DEM Event | Safe State |
| SM-02 | WDG Alive Supervision | B | WdgM | DEM Event | ECU Reset |
| SM-03 | E2E CRC + Counter | B | E2E Lib | COM Error | Default Value |
| SM-04 | ADC Self-Test | B | MCAL | DTC | Degraded Mode |
| SM-05 | Output Read-back | B | MCAL | DTC | Safe Value |
| SM-06 | Memory ECC | B | HW | ECC IRQ | Correction / Reset |
| SM-07 | PWM Monitor | A | MCAL | DTC | Disable Output |
| SM-08 | Voltage Monitor | B | ADC | DEM Event | Controlled Shutdown |
